    "body": "> I forgot to say: an attribute called contextLost makes sense to me.\r\n\r\nOriginally that was our proposal (and implementation). \r\n\r\nThe problem is [WebGL](https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/#5.14.13) uses `isContextLost()` (on `WebGLRenderingContext`). So maybe keeping it the same on `CanvasRenderingContext2D` makes more sense? WDYT?",
